        {
          "text": "Omundu yesi yesi oria kamalaka ka Wele amenya mu buambaani ne Wele mala Wele yesi amenya mu buambaani ne naye. Ne sikila Roho niye Wele aakhuelesia efwe, khumanyile khuli Wele amenyile mu buambaani ne nafwe.",
